{"german_text": "Das Ozonloch ist ein globales Problem.", "english_translation": "The ozone hole is a global problem.", "arabic_translation": "ثقب الأوزون مشكلة عالمية.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 6, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Ich habe einen Kompost angelegt.", "english_translation": "I created a compost.", "arabic_translation": "أنشأت سمادًا.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Die Jahreszeiten ändern sich.", "english_translation": "The seasons change.", "arabic_translation": "تتغير الفصول.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Ich verwende wiederverwendbare Taschen.", "english_translation": "I use reusable bags.", "arabic_translation": "أستخدم حقائب قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
