{"german_text": "Ich habe einen Baum gespendet.", "english_translation": "I donated a tree.", "arabic_translation": "تبرعت بشجرة.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Die Wälder werden abgeholzt.", "english_translation": "The forests are being deforested.", "arabic_translation": "يتم قطع الغابات.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Ich habe eine Umwelt-AG an der Schule gegründet.", "english_translation": "I founded an environmental club at school.", "arabic_translation": "أسست ناديًا بيئيًا في المدرسة.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 6, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Der Regen hat den Staub weggespült.", "english_translation": "The rain washed away the dust.", "arabic_translation": "غسل المطر الغبار.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Environment"},
{"german_text": "Ich verwende kein Pestizid in meinem Garten.", "english_translation": "I don't use pesticides in my garden.", "arabic_translation": "لا أستخدم المبيدات في حديقتي.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 6, "category": "Environment"},
