{"german_text": "Ich habe einen Streit mit meinem Freund gehabt.", "english_translation": "I had an argument with my friend.", "arabic_translation": "كان لدي خلاف مع صديقي.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Relationships"},
