{"german_text": "Ich muss meine Gefühle ausdrücken.", "english_translation": "I need to express my feelings.", "arabic_translation": "علي التعبير عن مشاعري.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Relationships"},
{"german_text": "Es ist wichtig, Kompromisse zu finden.", "english_translation": "It's important to find compromises.", "arabic_translation": "من المهم إيجاد حلول وسط.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 6, "category": "Relationships"},
{"german_text": "Ich habe eine neue Freundschaft geschlossen.", "english_translation": "I made a new friendship.", "arabic_translation": "عقدت صداقة جديدة.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 6, "category": "Relationships"},
{"german_text": "Ich bin wütend auf meinen Nachbarn.", "english_translation": "I am angry with my neighbor.", "arabic_translation": "أنا غاضب من جارتي.", "level": "B1", "difficulty_score": 5, "category": "Relationships"},
